2. Base attribution  (additional condition)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Source code that is derived from the Software, and that you distribute, must
carry a readable statement of where it came from — naming Loment and the FujoOS
Project. Put it somewhere a reader will find it, such as a NOTICE file or the
README:

